Package: microwave-server
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: libc6@LIBC_DEP@, libgcc-s1, ca-certificates, adduser, logrotate
Recommends: sqlite3
Homepage: https://github.com/rmoriz/microwave-development
Description: Chef Infra Server API-compatible server
 Microwave Server is a Rust reimplementation of the Chef Infra Server API,
 designed as a drop-in replacement for existing clients and operations
 tooling. It supports SQLite and PostgreSQL metadata backends, an embedded
 search index or OpenSearch, local or S3-compatible object storage, signed
 request authentication, and the policyfile/ACL surface.
 .
 This package installs the microwave-server service, the microwave-ctl and
 chef-server-ctl administration tools, the microwave-migrate snapshot
 importer, a systemd unit, and a default configuration under
 /etc/microwave.
